 the court."\n\n**Step 6 — Address the bullying:** "The name-calling is not okay, and that is worth talking about separately. Has anyone at school — a teacher, counselor, coach — been helpful? Would it help if I wrote a letter to your school counselor explaining the medical situation?"',
